stateDiagram-v2
  state "S-D03-009-01 Stopped" as stopped
  state "S-D03-009-02 WaitingForWakeWord" as wake
  state "S-D03-009-03 AcknowledgingWake" as ack
  state "S-D03-009-04 WaitingForCommand" as command
  state "S-D03-009-05 ProcessingCommand" as processing
  state "S-D03-009-06 Speaking" as speaking
  state "S-D03-009-07 WaitingForCommandResult" as result
  [*] --> stopped
  stopped --> wake: eligible and stream ready
  wake --> ack: trusted wake
  ack --> command: cue terminal and current owner
  ack --> processing: trusted same utterance command
  command --> processing: trusted final
  command --> wake: 6s timeout or second low confidence
  processing --> result: pending work and 1.2s without output
  processing --> speaking: output starts
  result --> ack: new trusted wake
  result --> speaking: result output starts
  speaking --> wake: work ended and quiet 500ms
  result --> stopped: work 30s timeout
  speaking --> stopped: stalled output 130s
  wake --> stopped: stop or eligibility lost
  command --> stopped: stop or eligibility lost
  ack --> stopped: stop or owner lost
  processing --> stopped: terminal failure
